<title>MEXICO: U.S. soybean sales to Mexico - update to Dec 28.</title>
<headline>U.S. soybean sales to Mexico - update to Dec 28.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Soybean Association updated Thursday, via its local office, U.S. exports of soybeans to Mexico.</p>
<p>Volumes are in tonnes, accumulated week-on-week for the marketing year Sept 1-Aug 31.</p>
<p>    Week Ending    Accum Total    Week Ending    Accum Total</p>
<p>    01/11/95	    365,700	30/10/96	   351,000</p>
<p>    08/11/95	    382,700	06/11/96	   405,000</p>
<p>    16/11/95	    449,300	20/11/96	   503,000</p>
<p>    29/11/95	    480,500	29/11/96	   600,700</p>
<p>    06/12/95	    500,700	05/12/96	   687,600</p>
<p>    28/12/95	    665,000	25/12/96	   926,400</p>
<p>((--Timna Tanners, Mexico City newsroom (525) 7289530))</p>
</text>
